    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Could you expand on that last part regarding the fragmentation patterns? I'm particularly interested in the degradation of the Amadori products under high-heat conditions. How do these pathways eventually lead to the formation of specific melanoidins and the various heterocyclic compounds responsible for the complex scents we associate with roasted foods?",
